name: Nacho Tong — extra hands
author: corpus
description: >-
  Nacho Tong permanently gives +2 hands per round. Tier-2 voucher: requires Grabber bought
  first, so the earliest practical target is Ante 2. RAG aliases: extra hands, more plays,
  hand-count scaling, survival voucher.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - voucher: NachoTong
    antes: [2]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
should:
  - joker: GreenJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Burglar
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - joker: RideTheBus
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
